    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d240">

                <pb facs="0417" n="387" sameAs="frus:frus1952-54Guat/pg387"/>

                <head>240. Telegram From the Central Intelligence Agency to Operation PBSUCCESS
                    Headquarters in Florida<anchor n="1" xml:id="d240-f1"/></head>
                <dateline><placeName>Washington</placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                        when="1954-06-27T00:27:00+00:00">June 27, 1954, 0027Z</date>.</dateline>
                <p>06737. Recommend one more adverse reference to UFCO by SHERWOOD. Reports arriving
                    here that since UFCO not attacked by RUFUS he must be UFCO man. Believe you have
                    proper line for this already; viz. new regime will not put up with UFCO if it
                    persists reactionary outmoded tactics and unsatisfactory labor relations.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
