                <p>Source: Central Intelligence Agency, Job 79–01025A, Box 9, Folder 3. Secret;
                    Priority; RYBAT; PBSUCCESS. Drafted by [<hi rendition="#italic">name not
                        declassified</hi>] and released by [<hi rendition="#italic">name not
                        declassified</hi>] at Wisner’s direction.</p>
            </note>
